title: Ship current SearXNG API transport and agent contract discovery
description: "Close the verified 2026.7.31 compatibility gaps by adding POST search transport, validated RSS output, Prometheus metrics resource access, exhaustive nested help, machine-readable CLI contract discovery, current dependencies, and exact live/package/release proof."
type: Plan
status: closed
priority: 0
