author: codex-searxng-20260731
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "CLI supports official GET and application/x-www-form-urlencoded POST searches with equivalent normalized results and HTML fallback; RSS is a validated documented output format while TOON remains the default and JSON/JSONL/CSV/YAML/XML/Markdown/HTML/text contracts remain stable; instance metrics exposes /metrics in TOON, JSON, and exact raw form with truthful unavailable handling; every command and nested operation has detailed help plus a machine-readable TOON-default command contract for agents; all settings/cache/history/data remain under ~/.searxng-cli, cache limits remain zero/unlimited, and local routing remains http://192.168.1.183:38522; latest compatible pm-cli, pm-changelog, runtime dependencies, 100/100/100/100 coverage, docstrings, lint, duplication, security, live installed CLI, npm/Bun package, release, CI, and bot review gates pass"
definition_of_ready: "All 57 PM items, histories, relationships, duplicates, latest official SearXNG source/docs, live 2026.7.31 service, TOON, registry dependencies, GitHub state, and current CLI contracts have been inspected."
goal: Complete current SearXNG API compatibility
objective: "Agent-discoverable, release-ready CLI transport and output contracts"
value: Agents and automation can discover and use every supported transport/resource/output path without source inspection
impact: "Closes missing POST, RSS, and metrics coverage while reducing command-discovery ambiguity"
outcome: Reviewed and merged CLI release candidate validated against the governed live service and isolated npm/Bun consumers
why_now: The governed service advanced to 2026.7.31 and direct upstream comparison exposed three concrete unsupported surfaces after the prior parity release.
reviewer: github-bots
risk: high
confidence: 95
sprint: 2026-07-current-api
release: 2026.7.31
resolution: "Official GET/POST transport, validated RSS, optional authenticated metrics, versioned command discovery, global-state/setup contracts, documentation, tests, reviews, and release gates shipped in PR #62."
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria pass on exact reviewed head, merged master, local governed SearXNG service, and isolated consumers."
actual_result: 962 tests at 100/100/100/100; 21 live diagnostics; 62 black-box E2E tests; all required GitHub checks green; zero unresolved review threads; merged SHA 4dc60d3c6f95f1fdfb1587daf61e0f6af57198da.
