comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:19.636Z",codex-searxng-20260731,All-status duplicate searches found no metrics or RSS item. Closed predecessors cover earlier general parity but not the verified 2026.7.31 delta; this successor preserves canonical lineage rather than reopening or duplicating completed work.
  "2026-07-31T21:02:37.479Z",codex-searxng-20260731,"Security and package gates passed: Trivy reported zero HIGH/CRITICAL findings, history secret scan passed, and isolated npx/bunx package smoke resolved both executable aliases. Initial release acceptance then found stale instance-envelope assertions, now corrected to validate .data."
  "2026-07-31T21:03:51.110Z",codex-searxng-20260731,"Full release:check is green at 2026.7.31 after correcting typed resource assertions: 962 tests with exact 100/100/100/100, 21 live built-in diagnostics, forced-network POST RSS, optional metrics capability handling, global settings under ~/.searxng-cli, and isolated executable resolution."
  "2026-07-31T21:31:24.307Z",codex-searxng-20260731,"CodeRabbit exact-head review produced eleven inline threads. Corrected command catalog completeness, nested value-less help, RSS URL/date normalization, schema parity, parser-backed structural validation, metrics semantics, Markdown tables, E2E artifact placement, and explicitly reasserted PM claim ownership. The generated pm-changelog audit script is package-owned, outside the SearXNG runtime, and must not be hand-edited because extension refresh would overwrite it; that upstream-extension finding is dispositioned with scope evidence rather than copied into product code. Targeted correction coverage remains exact 100/100/100/100 across 962 tests."
  "2026-07-31T21:44:14.380Z",codex-searxng-20260731,PR #62 exact implementation head 75ead0778e1ab218b0be8ccf47f872a778603022 passed all required GitHub checks. Fresh delayed inventory found zero unresolved threads after every bot review/comment received a usefulness reaction and individual disposition. GitHub squash-merged it as 4dc60d3c6f95f1fdfb1587daf61e0f6af57198da on master.
  "2026-07-31T21:51:28.205Z",codex-searxng-20260731,"Immutable release proof: Auto Release run 30667744114 succeeded, created signed tag v2026.7.31 at dd4714408dba9f30769b8eaf0aaef8d7d0d8ae9c, published GitHub release https://github.com/unbraind/searxng-cli/releases/tag/v2026.7.31, and published npm latest searxng-cli@2026.7.31. Fresh prefix-isolated npm installation exposed 19 command contracts and completed forced-network POST RSS against http://192.168.1.183:38522; the maintained verifier passed npm, npx, and bunx with executable containment. Final global searxng was explicitly upgraded from the prior installed 2026.7.26 package to 2026.7.31 and repeated command discovery plus POST RSS behavior. The old global binary's cwd-derived version display reinforced why behavioral and realpath verification must accompany version assertions."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:19.636Z",codex-searxng-20260731,Official master search API documents GET/POST and JSON/CSV/RSS. The live service reports 2026.7.31+057a77168. Preserve JSON-first/HTML fallback because instance JSON search may be disabled; POST must use form encoding and never leak params to logs.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:19.636Z",codex-searxng-20260731,"Completeness claims must be refreshed against current source and live routes: the prior stable resource list omitted /metrics and the local format set omitted RSS."
