  plan-step-005,5,"Publish PR, converge all current-head checks/reviews, merge, release, and verify",completed,"2026-07-31T20:21:19.630Z","2026-07-31T21:44:15.301Z",PR #62 exact head 75ead077 passed Node/Bun/package/Gitleaks/CodeQL/title checks; eleven CodeRabbit threads were corrected or evidence-dispositioned with zero unresolved; retriggers were acknowledged; squash merge 4dc60d3 landed on master.,"2026-07-31T21:44:15.301Z"
body: "## Current delta\\n\\nOfficial SearXNG master and the governed 2026.7.31 service expose supported behavior absent from the current CLI: POST form search transport, RSS search output, and /metrics. Agent workflows also need a self-describing command contract and precise nested help without source inspection.\\n\\n## Delivery\\n\\nImplement these as one typed compatibility bundle while preserving TOON default output, the configured LAN service, global ~/.searxng-cli state, unlimited cache, JSON-first HTML fallback, exact output schemas, and automated daily release behavior.\\n\\n## Evidence policy\\n\\nLink every changed file/doc/test; validate direct source, installed package, local service, npm/Bun consumers, exact PR head, review threads, merged head, and immutable release state without recording private payloads."
